00:01:44,240 --> 00:02:00,000
In 2013 and 2014, I was building a company called Oyster, and it was the Netflix for ebooks, and I had the very good fortune to have as a mentor this guy, Barry McCarthy, who most recently joined Peloton as the CEO, but before that was at Spotify.

20
