Everybody is relieved at this stage not having to read a thread.

39
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:30,480
So, yeah, exactly.

40
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:31,280
No threads.

41
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:31,920
No threads.

