00:23:08,560 --> 00:23:13,280
What's more important is that you reach some sort of asymptote, which basically means at some point.

272
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,440
point that churn starts to level out.

273
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:19,680
And so maybe it's 15% in month one, but in month two it's 10.

