00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:29,840
Then it, you know, it's kind of starts leveling out and doesn't keep dropping at a linear rate.

277
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,040
That's actually more important.

278
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:41,440
And so that was the, that was the genesis of writing about it, because it wasn't something that I understood as an entrepreneur, but when I learned it, it really gave me a new lens with which to think about my business.

